  m_Name: Dialogue 2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueLines:
  - You can enter "Arrogant mode" at anytime
  - When arrogant, your roll is replaced by a "Side-step Spin"
  - It is considered extremely cocky to use it to evade enemy attacks
  - This will surelly help you gain more Arrogance and enter the Insolence state
    faster !
